  q1)Z Pattern bookmark_borderPrint Z pattern using '*'. See examples for more details.

Input Format
The first line of input contains T - number of test cases. It is followed by T lines, each line contains a single integer N - the size of the Z pattern.
Output Format
For each test case, print the test case number as shown, followed by the Z pattern, separated by a newline.
Constraints
1 <= T <= 50
3 <= N <= 100
Example
Input
3
3
6
5
Output
Case #1:***
 *
***
Case #2:******
    *
   *
  *
 *
******
Case #3:
*****
   *
  *
 *
*****
##  code :
n=int(input())
for k in range(1,n+1):
    l=int(input())
    print(f"Case #{k}:")
    for i in range(l):
        for j in range(l):
            if(i==0 or i==l-1 or j==l-i-1):
                print("*",end="")
            else:
                print(" ",end="")
        print("")
